  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1050597,
    "UIName": "Haruna",
    "Id": "chassisdef_haruna_HAR-101",
    "Name": "Haruna",
    "Details": "The HAR-101 is a Capellan experimental design commissioned by Sun Tzu Liao, blending mixed Inner Sphere and Clan technology into a fast close-range harasser. Stealth armor powered by an ECM suite and MASC pushing the 35-ton frame past 170 kph make it extremely difficult to engage reliably. A Vibroblade, twin Streak SRM 2s and a Heavy Medium Laser give it genuine bite once it closes, while an Active Probe rounds out the electronics suite.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_haruna"
  },
  "VariantName": "HAR-101",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "mr-resize-0.68"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "Hellespont Industrials built this for the Capellan Confederation on Sun Tzu Liao's personal commission. Stealth armor, MASC, Vibroblade, the whole package. The HAR-101 uses mixed tech from the Clans while the HAR-111 is a pure Inner Sphere build that they actually exported to the Magistracy and Fronc Reaches. Both versions are built around the same idea, get in faster than anyone expects, do damage, disappear before they can respond. That is a concept that works regardless of what tech you fill it with.",
